  "description": "Turns a Word or Excel document into SensitiveDataGateway segments: paragraphs, table\n      rows, headers, footers, comments, notes, sheet cells and formula text, plus the\n      package properties. It reads what the file holds and nothing else — it opens no\n      socket, resolves no entity, follows no link, and refuses a document whose content it\n      cannot read in place.",
